Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-yaml, python3-gi, gir1.2-secret-1, python3-pycryptodome, ${dlp:sqlcipher}, poppler-utils, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~), systemd (>= 247)
Recommends: libnotify-bin, gir1.2-atspi-2.0
Description: experimental Linux endpoint data loss prevention agent
 Controls file opens by an administrator-selected Telegram and Signal executables using
 fanotify, an unprivileged content analyzer, and a systemd system service.
 Includes text, PDF and DOCX analysis, an offline Signal database check,
 local CLI and optional session tools.
 This research prototype does not guarantee interception of every file transfer.
